7. NEGATIVE TEST SWEEP — SETUP
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Global 'lldp timer' temporarily reduced 30 -> 10 s so each phase captures multiple
frames. This changes transmission cadence and TTL only; it does not affect TLV
content. Confirmed in capture: TTL reported 40 s throughout the sweep
(timer 10 x hold-time multiplier 4 = 40), vs 120 s at the default timer 30.
Timer restored to 30 at end of run.

Exact CLI keyword set confirmed on-device before use ('lldp tlv-select ?'):
  all, link-aggregation, mac-phy-config, management-address, max-frame-size,
  port-and-protocol-vlans, port-description, port-vlan, power-management,
  protocol-ids, system-capabilities, system-description, system-name, vlan-names

